The candleabrum is in Vlad's tower.  Vlad's tower is accessed from a
level in Gehannom with an extra up staircase.  This level always 
appears somewhere between the 13th and 18th level of Gehannom.  Which
dungeon level that is varies a little, but if you work your way back
up you can find which six levels you need to search.  Once you get 
to Vlad's tower you won't have any trouble; Vlad is a wuss.

Check recent posts for a spoiler about where the vibrating square 
may appear.  It's on the lowest level you can get to (54 in your
case, unless you're missing a staircase) and away from the walls
and stairs up.  Once you've narrowed it down to a square in which
it may appear, you just have to hunt.  I do it as a Xorn to speed 
things up, but that cuts down your AC and HP so it might not 
be the best idea with The Wiz on your butt. 

Sorry about your holy water supply.  I hope you have a few blessed 
scrolls of remove curse tucked away in your BoH.  The Wiz can be 
such a pain when you're trying to plod along, minding your own
business.  Especially when he curses your BoH.  "Overtaxed?  Can't
teleport?  What the..."

